title: The 3AM Neighbor
id: the-3am-neighbor
lang: en
voice: young_storyteller

cast:
me    kid spiky #f2d232 | stripes_h #e7c43f #151515 | pants #151515
mom   adult bun #2a1d17 | cardigan #f0a6b8 #fff3f6 | pants #3b4a6b
dad   adult short #4a3426 | plaid #3a6ea5 #1d2b45 | pants #555555 | glasses
beast creature furry_giant

== card night
On our street, the power goes out at 3:00 every night. | card:clock text=3:00 title=AM push
== suburban_street night
Exactly 3:00. | est push
== kitchen day
Mom says it's the old wires. | med mom:talk
Dad says don't look outside. | cu dad:worried push q:dad
== bedroom night
So of course, I looked. | med me:wide_eyes>window
Through my window, | ots me >across pov:vignette
== rooftops_sky night
I saw something taller than the power poles. | est beast@giant:loom
Black fur. | cu beast:loom push
A grin full of teeth. | xcu beast push
== suburban_street night
It walked down the street, | wide beast:walk@road
checking every house. | est beast:lean@road push
Like counting. | cu me:scared push
== house_front day
The next morning, | est push
there was a note on our door. | card:note title="DEAR NEIGHBOR" text="You looked." push
Mom read it twice. | med mom:worried:letter
Then she taped the window shut. | mcu mom:look_down
== card night
Tonight, the lights went out at 2:59. | card:clock text=2:59 title=AM push
== bedroom night
One minute early. | cu me:wide_eyes push
And something is knocking. | wide me:scared>door shake
Not on the door. | cu me:scared push
== rooftops_sky night
On the roof. | low beast:reach@giant push
